# TaskDetail.start-vm-auto-authorization.playwright.test.js

## 意图

`start-vm-auto` 请求体含 `authorization_id` 时，不得误报「未配置云平台授权」。

## 验收

- 经网关 POST start-vm-auto：响应不含「未配置云平台授权」，HTTP 非 400
- 成功时 `status=success` 且含 `event_id`

## 根因（回归）

CPA 真源在 taskCloudService SQLite；Django `persist_start_vm_auto_records` 须 `filter(id=..., company_id=...)` 走 Go facade。

## 运行

```bash
PLAYWRIGHT_SITE_ORIGIN=http://183.250.1.132:4000 \
PLAYWRIGHT_GATEWAY_ORIGIN=http://183.250.1.132:18081 \
npx playwright test tests/TaskDetail.start-vm-auto-authorization.playwright.test.js \
  --config=playwright.config.chromium.js
```
